   "detail": {
    "seconds": 6.85,
    "decision": "proceed",
    "plan": "Question: Which marketing channels had the highest shop-attributed return on marketing spend in 2026 to date?\nMetrics: marketing_spend, Last-click attributed revenue = SUM(marketing_attribution.credit_last_click * marketing_attribution.order_revenue), Last-click ROAS = last-click attributed revenue / marketing_spend; null when spend is zero, Last-click credited orders = SUM(marketing_attribution.credit_last_click)\nBreakdowns: campaigns.channel\nFilters: none\nTime window: 2026-01-01 to 2026-11-14 inclusive\nComparison: none\nExpected result: One row per channel with marketing spend, credited orders, attributed revenue and ROAS; sort by ROAS descending, with at most 50 rows.\nAssumptions: Use last-click attribution and shop-recorded revenue rather than platform-reported revenue.; The supplied definition does not establish whether attribution order_revenue is realized revenue; treat it as a proxy, not a verified realized-revenue measure.; Attribute orders by order_at and spend by date_hour within the window; spend and resulting orders need not occur in the same period.; Include campaign-linked channels with spend, including affiliate and CRM; exclude Direct/Organic because it has no campaign spend.; Recent orders may have incomplete returns and realized revenue."
   },
   "t": 6.97
  },
  {
   "type": "step",
   "step": "write_sql",
   "status": "started",
   "detail": {},
   "t": 6.97
  },
  {
   "type": "step",
   "step": "write_sql",
   "status": "done",
   "detail": {
    "seconds": 6.37,
    "attempt": 1,
    "sql": "WITH spend AS (\n  SELECT c.channel, SUM m.spend AS marketing_spend\n  FROM marketing_spend m\n  JOIN campaigns c ON c.campaign_id = m.campaign_id\n  WHERE m.date_hour >= TIMESTAMP '2026-01-01'\n    AND m.date_hour < TIMESTAMP '2026-11-15'\n  GROUP BY c.channel\n), attribution AS (\n  SELECT c.channel,\n         SUM(a.credit_last_click) AS credited_orders,\n         SUM(a.credit_last_click * a.order_revenue) AS attributed_revenue\n  FROM marketing_attribution a\n  JOIN campaigns c ON c.campaign_id = a.campaign_id\n  WHERE a.order_at >= TIMESTAMP '2026-01-01'\n    AND a.order_at < TIMESTAMP '2026-11-15'\n  GROUP BY c.channel\n)\nSELECT s.channel,\n       s.marketing_spend,\n       COALESCE(a.credited_orders, 0) AS credited_orders,\n       COALESCE(a.attributed_revenue, 0) AS attributed_revenue,\n       COALESCE(a.attributed_revenue, 0) / NULLIF(s.marketing_spend, 0) AS last_click_roas\nFROM spend s\nLEFT JOIN attribution a ON s.channel IS NOT DISTINCT FROM a.channel\nORDER BY last_click_roas DESC NULLS LAST, s.channel\nLIMIT 50",
    "explanation": "Ranks campaign-linked channels by last-click attributed revenue per rupee spent in the specified period. Attribution revenue is a proxy, not verified realized revenue; spend and attributed orders need not occur in the same period."
   },
